description         A GPU-accelerated terminal emulator with kitty graphics

long_description    grimalkin is a GPU-accelerated terminal emulator written \
                    in Rust with the kitty graphics and keyboard protocols, \
                    themes with live reload and WinAMP-style skins.

categories          aqua shells
installs_libs       no
